                },
                {
                  "text": "<div>Red bag</div>",
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "<div>Correct. The plastic cannula is recyclable contaminated plastic — it has contacted patient blood and goes into the red bag for autoclaving followed by recycling.</div>",
